WEBVTT

00:07:59.156 --> 00:08:03.196
But if I want to have,

00:08:03.236 --> 00:08:06.796
maybe, a special dress,

00:08:06.796 --> 00:08:10.036
I may have to go
to a town center and get it.

00:08:10.036 --> 00:08:14.356
So we actually cascade them in ranking.

00:08:14.396 --> 00:08:16.996
And in a similar way,

00:08:17.036 --> 00:08:23.596
in a city, I would plan for hospitals
in different regions.

00:08:23.956 --> 00:08:26.236
Universities in different regions.

00:08:26.276 --> 00:08:28.076
But below that, in new towns,

00:08:28.076 --> 00:08:30.196
I would plan for a polytechnic.